# The runner image build (docker build -f runner/Dockerfile .) uses the
# repo root as context so it can COPY src/ + pyproject.toml. Allowlist
# style: everything is excluded, then the few things the image needs are
# let back in — datasets/, .git/, runs/, site/ etc. never reach the
# builder.
*
!pyproject.toml
!src
src/hokea.egg-info
src/**/__pycache__
!runner
